### Get all announcements
GET {{baseUrl}}/announcements

### Replace with a real _id from GET /announcements
GET {{baseUrl}}/announcements/66f1f53b6b39b57b5a147914

### Create an announcement
POST {{baseUrl}}/announcements
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Demo Announcement",
  "message": "This announcement proves the fourth collection is working.",
  "audience": "all",
  "publishDate": "2026-09-30T12:00:00.000Z",
  "expiresAt": "2026-10-30T12:00:00.000Z",
  "isPinned": true,
  "authorEmail": "announcements@example.edu"
}

### Update an announcement
PUT {{baseUrl}}/announcements/66f1f53b6b39b57b5a147914
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Updated Announcement",
  "message": "Updated announcement details.",
  "audience": "students",
  "publishDate": "2026-09-30T12:00:00.000Z",
  "expiresAt": "2026-10-30T12:00:00.000Z",
